        },
        {
          "id": "d17-s8",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "8. Outlook",
          "heading": 2,
          "style": "h2",
          "tocEntry": "8. Outlook",
          "tocLevel": 2,
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 121.5
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d17-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "For Q1 2026 the plan assumes a return to hiring in engineering and customer success. The board approved a capital expenditure budget of $20.5M for Q1 2026, weighted towards data-centre capacity and network hardware.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 135.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d17-s8-p11",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Management notes that comparisons to the prior year are affected by the change in revenue recognition adopted at the start of the fiscal year.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 160
          },
          "width": 166
        }
